 waterfall water fountains, the sound of the motor is louder than that of the water jump. This you should avoid because in the long run, it can bother. And we say this from experience.  Find some Feng Shui waterfall walls outdoors with which you can only hear the relaxing noise of the water falling.   \tThe size:  You must follow your intuition again since no size is the most recommended, but it is a matter of taste and the place where you want to place it.  A waterfall walls outdoors will always be larger than waterfall walls indoor, and the sound of falling water will also be louder. Inside, for space, the Feng Shui waterfall water fountain will be smaller, logically. But we encourage you not to be conditioned by this. Waterfall walls indoors or outdoors? So far, we have been talking about the waterfall water features as objects, but could we just put the sound of the source? Yes, we could use it. That is, put background music that represented the sound of a natural waterfall. In this way, we would also be activating the energy. It would be through sound.  With all this that we have told you, would you have a waterfall water feature?  If you like waterfall water features, go ahead and follow all these tips that we have offered you to find your ideal waterfall water fountain or a small waterfall window.",
