<main id="content" class="site-main post mt-article"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Waterfall Water Features: Explore Waterfall Water Fountains And Feng Shui</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="mt-article-meta"><time datetime="2022-01-20T15:50:50">January 20, 2022</time></p><figure class="mt-article-hero"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-950x320.avif 950w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px" width="1200" height="800" alt="Waterfall Water Features Explore Waterfall Water Fountains And Feng Shui" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><div class="mt-article-body"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="82867" data-permalink="https://www.midwest-tropical.com/waterfall-water-features-explore-waterfall-water-fountains-and-feng-shui-3/" data-orig-file="/wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1.jpg" data-orig-size="1200,800" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Waterfall Water Features Explore Waterfall Water Fountains And Feng Shui" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="/wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg.avif" crossorigin="anonymous" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-82867" title="Waterfall Water Features Explore Waterfall Water Fountains And Feng Shui" src="/wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui.jpg" alt="Waterfall Water Features Explore Waterfall Water Fountains And Feng Shui" width="1200" height="800" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-600x400.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg-950x320.avif 950w, /wp-content/uploads/Waterfall-Water-Features-Explore-Waterfall-Water-Fountains-And-Feng-Shui-1-jpg.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-mtfi="1" /></p>
<p>Water is one of the 5 elements through which we achieve harmony at our place. It attracts wealth, prosperity, and abundance. And it is that, who does not relax listening to the waterfall wave from waterfall water fountains?</p>
<p>If you close your eyes and imagine a small waterfall water feature surrounded by nature, it transmits immense peace and serenity. If you want to know a little more about them and how to use them, keep reading.</p>
<ol>
<li>
<h2>Are water sources essential to have a good Feng Shui?</h2>
</li>
</ol>
<p>The answer is very simple: no. You will think that how can this be possible, water being one of the 5 elements with which we achieve harmony in Feng Shui.</p>
<p>This is because if you do not like waterfall water features, it is better not to have them.</p>
<p>A waterfall window source is one of the possible elements, but not the only one. You can get the water element in another way, such as with the color blue or a painting of the sea.</p>
<p>But if you have waterfall walls indoor that you buy because somewhere you have read that it is good for Feng Shui, knowing that it is an object that does not go with you or your decoration will become unused junk. And what do I recommend to do with the junk? Get rid of them.</p>
<ol start="2">
<li>
<h2>Characteristics that you should take into account when choosing Feng Shui waterfall water fountains</h2>
</li>
</ol>
<p>Water is a very powerful element in Feng Shui. Therefore, if you have decided to get waterfall water fountains because you like it, here are some guidelines that you should take into account:</p>
<ul>
<li>The shape and what it represents:</li>
</ul>
<p>In this case, you should pay close attention to the room where you want to place it and if that font makes sense with the rest of the decorative objects.</p>
<ul>
<li>Sound:</li>
</ul>
<p>Once you have chosen your ideal waterfall water feature, now you have to consider the sound of the water falling. Do you like it? Find a sound that pleases you and relaxes you.</p>
<p>Of course, you also have to take into account the engine noise. It often happens that, in small waterfall water fountains, the sound of the motor is louder than that of the water jump. This you should avoid because in the long run, it can bother. And we say this from experience.</p>
<p>Find some Feng Shui waterfall walls outdoors with which you can only hear the relaxing noise of the water falling.</p>
<ul>
<li>The size:</li>
</ul>
<p>You must follow your intuition again since no size is the most recommended, but it is a matter of taste and the place where you want to place it.</p>
<p>A waterfall walls outdoors will always be larger than waterfall walls indoor, and the sound of falling water will also be louder. Inside, for space, the Feng Shui waterfall water fountain will be smaller, logically. But we encourage you not to be conditioned by this.</p>
<h2>Waterfall walls indoors or outdoors?</h2>
<p>So far, we have been talking about the waterfall water features as objects, but could we just put the sound of the source? Yes, we could use it. That is, put background music that represented the sound of a natural waterfall. In this way, we would also be activating the energy. It would be through sound.</p>
<p>With all this that we have told you, would you have a waterfall water feature?</p>
<p>If you like waterfall water features, go ahead and follow all these tips that we have offered you to find your ideal waterfall water fountain or a small waterfall window.</p>
</div></div></main>

